{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_153_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_153","textTraditional":"一、三年，春，楚公子嬰齊帥師伐吳。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_153_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_153","textTraditional":"二、公如晉。夏，四月，壬戌，公及晉侯盟於長樗。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_153_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_153","textTraditional":"三、公至自晉。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_153_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_153","textTraditional":"四、六月，公會單子、晉侯、宋公、衞侯、鄭伯、莒子、邾子、齊世子光，己未，同盟於雞澤。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_153_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_153","textTraditional":"同者，有同也，同外楚也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_153_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_153","textTraditional":"五、陳侯使袁僑如會。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_153_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_153","textTraditional":"如會，外乎會也，於會受命也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_153_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_153","textTraditional":"六、戊寅，叔孫豹及諸侯之大夫及陳袁僑盟。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_153_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_153","textTraditional":"及以及，與之也。諸侯以為可與，則與之；不可與，則釋之。諸侯盟，又大夫相與私盟，是大夫張也。故雞澤之會，諸侯始失正矣，大夫執國權。曰袁僑，異之也。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_153_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_153","textTraditional":"七、秋，公至自會。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_153_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_153","textTraditional":"八、冬，晉荀罃帥師伐許。","sentenceOrder":11}],"overrides":{}}